From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:04:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wintab.dll16, krnl386.exe16: documented no-op answers instead
 of FIXME stubs

wintab.dll16 reports no tablet consistently (every context handle is invalid); the kernel functions that are hints or report a retail system (debug info, thread boost, swap area, handle tables, tool help hook) trace instead of logging stubs.

Unverified: no 16 bit runtime or compiler is available here, so this is compile-checked only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

